<title>BELGIUM: FORECAST - Belgian c.bank raises 96 growth forecast.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Belgian c.bank raises 96 growth forecast.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian central bank has revised its forecast for 1996 real Gross Domestic Product (GDP) growth to 1.4 percent, from 1.2 percent, figures published in the Belgian Primary Dealers Association's newsletter showed.</p>
<p>A central bank spokesman confirmed the new forecast.</p>
</text>
